<title>USA: Westmoreland Coal Co Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Westmoreland Coal Co Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.14	 loss     $12.10</p>
<p> Net profit	2,161	 loss     82,987</p>
<p> Revs		17,461		   23,780</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  6,965		    6,961</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$1.44	  loss    $13.74</p>
<p> Net profit	13,682	 loss    91,952</p>
<p> Revs		50,127		   112,717</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  6,965		    6,961</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Loss reported for Q3 1995 primarily due to the recognition of $91.2 million in liabilities in connection with the August 1995 idling of the company's Virginia Division coal mining operations.</p>
